Camoufox: geolocation:latitude/longitude (and accuracy) are the position a page
gets. AliasMode: the page still asks for it as on stock Firefox (the permission
prompt, a stored grant or a denial), and with the position configured no OS
location service, Wi-Fi scan or network location request starts.

